:281;s:11:"question_en";s:25:"What are common symptoms?";s:9:"answer_en";s:34:"Back pain, leg pain, and numbness.";s:11:"question_hi";s:61:"सामान्य लक्षण क्या हैं?";s:9:"answer_hi";s:78:"पीठ दर्द, पैर दर्द और सुन्नपन।";s:10:"sort_order";i:3;}i:1213;a:7:{s:2:"id";i:1214;s:10:"disease_id";i:281;s:11:"question_en";s:20:"How is it diagnosed?";s:9:"answer_en";s:47:"Clinical examination and MRI are commonly used.";s:11:"question_hi";s:49:"निदान कैसे होता है?";s:9:"answer_hi";s:54:"परीक्षण और MRI द्वारा।";s:10:"sort_order";i:4;}i:1214;a:7:{s:2:"id";i:1215;s:10:"disease_id";i:281;s:11:"question_en";s:23:"Can physiotherapy help?";s:9:"answer_en";s:40:"Yes, physiotherapy may improve symptoms.";s:11:"question_hi";s:80:"क्या फिजियोथेरेपी मदद करती है?";s:9:"answer_hi";s:69:"हाँ, इससे सुधार हो सकता है।";s:10:"sort_order";i:5;}i:1215;a:7:{s:2:"id";i:1216;s:10:"disease_id";i:282;s:11:"question_en";s:17:"What is sciatica?";s:9:"answer_en";s:47:"Pain caused by irritation of the sciatic nerve.";s:11:"question_hi";s:42:"सायटिका क्या है?";s:9:"answer_hi";s:91:"सायटिक नस की जलन से होने वाला दर्द।";s:10:"sort_order";i:1;}i:1216;a:7:{s:2:"id";i:1217;s:10:"disease_id";i:282;s:11:"question_en";s:21:"What causes sciatica?";s:9:"answer_en";s:55:"Herniated discs and spinal disorders are common causes.";s:11:"question_hi";s:43:"यह क्यों होता है?";s:9:"answer_hi";s:121:"हर्नियेटेड डिस्क और रीढ़ विकार इसके कारण हैं।";s:10:"sort_order";i:2;}i:1217;a:7:{s:2:"id";i:1218;s:10:"disease_id";i:282;s:11:"question_en";s:25:"What are common symptoms?";s:9:"answer_en";s:52:"Pain radiating down the leg, numbness, and tingling.";s:11:"question_hi";s:61:"सामान्य लक्षण क्या हैं?";s:9:"answer_hi";s:116:"पैर में फैलने वाला दर्द, सुन्नपन और झुनझुनी।";s:10:"sort_order";i:3;}i:1218;a:7:{s:2:"id";i:1219;s:10:"disease_id";i:282;s:11:"question_en";s:18:"Can exercise help?";s:9:"answer_en";s:43:"Appropriate exercises may improve symptoms.";s:11:"question_hi";s:65:"क्या व्यायाम मदद करता है?";s:9:"answer_hi";s:94:"हाँ, उचि